.git
.github
.claude
.agents
docs/
*.md
!go.sum
# The `build` stage compiles from source, and docs/embed.go embeds exactly these
# four files. They must survive the docs/ and *.md exclusions above or the
# go:embed directive fails at compile time. Later patterns win in .dockerignore,
# so these negations re-include the files inside the excluded directory.
!docs/embed.go
!docs/readme.md
!docs/quickstart.md
!docs/concepts.md
!docs/troubleshooting.md
*_test.go
outlook-local-mcp
*.out
*.test
.gitignore
.deepwiki
skills-lock.json
